<title>USA: Hilton puts Ladbroke chief on board.</title>
<headline>Hilton puts Ladbroke chief on board.</headline>
<dateline>BEVERLY HILLS, Calif. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hilton Hotels Corp on Friday said Peter George, chief executive of Ladbroke Group PLC, has been named to Hilton's board of directors.</p>
<p>The move is part of a strategic alliance signed earlier this month between Hilton and Ladbroke under which the companies plan to unite the Hilton brand name in the United States with overseas operations.</p>
<p>Ladbroke owns the Hilton brand outside the United States.</p>
<p>Hilton Chief Executive Officer Stephen F. Bollenbach has already joined Ladbroke's board of directors.</p>
